description |
  bench/capability@0.1 -- the capability survey set
  ([B42]). Sixty-four patterns in twelve capability/
  provenance families plus the floor, BUILT ON this
  format as its pattern source of truth. See
  docs/design/capability_set_v1.md and
  bench/capability/NOTES.md.

oracle pcre2
vocabulary family wild-validator wild-logparse wild-waf wild-secrets wild-datetime wild-codegrammar cap-backref cap-lookaround cap-recursion redos-nested semantics-divergence binary-nonutf8 floor
vocabulary hazard none exponential-backtracking ambiguous-decomposition
vocabulary requires backrefs lookaround lookbehind-variable possessive-quantifier atomic-group recursion conditionals k-reset control-verbs unicode-properties named-groups free-spacing callouts span-reporting non-utf8-subject captures true-end-anchor
vocabulary convention perl-leftmost-first posix-leftmost-longest
tag set=capability, version=0.1
ext bench
  roster pcre2-interp pcre2-jit pcrec-auto pcrec-nocaps pcrec-vm pcrec-vm-in pcre2-dfa onig-default
